        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "60a39e6d-68fd-3115-8345-dce9287ccd28",
                "word": "вручную",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be54201a-d02a-369e-abdf-45ff9f002ce2",
                        "entry_id": "60a39e6d-68fd-3115-8345-dce9287ccd28",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ручным способом, без применения механизмов, машин, приборов, автоматов, компьютера"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d89380fc-119e-4a77-8339-85a72fb6da93",
                                "sense_id": "be54201a-d02a-369e-abdf-45ff9f002ce2",
                                "text": "При расчистке дороги наткнулись на большой дикий камень, гранит, составлявший гребень подземной скалы, и не знали, как его сбыть с рук: вести для него дорогу в обход не хотелось, и потому принялись разбивать его вручную, молотами."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1babab86-2c58-4ede-b362-6897b3b8b0fc",
                                "sense_id": "be54201a-d02a-369e-abdf-45ff9f002ce2",
                                "text": "На сцене люки не действовали, подъёмы декораций производились «вручную»."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2cad8ced-9a2e-4dc8-a5e7-45022e243330",
                                "sense_id": "be54201a-d02a-369e-abdf-45ff9f002ce2",
                                "text": "Сели за длинный стол, накрытый розовой в белых узорах плотною скатертью, на которой шумел, пуская густые пары к низкому потолку, большой медный самовар и стояли сливки, свежее, вручную сбитое масло и разные домашние булочки и печенья."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc1e5b23-9f8b-4202-ac58-b98ab3f2b09d",
                                "sense_id": "be54201a-d02a-369e-abdf-45ff9f002ce2",
                                "text": "Было время, когда лес, с бранью и проклятьями, вручную, на верёвках, на плечах подтаскивали к реке для сплава; подвозить его на санях не было возможности: каменистая неровная почва ломала повозки любой конструкции."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe121bd6-4ed7-435d-a368-a12804b759d5",
                                "sense_id": "be54201a-d02a-369e-abdf-45ff9f002ce2",
                                "text": "Текст сначала набирают вручную или на наборной машине, и «страницу» с металлическими строчками переносят в печатную машину."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e8297fd6-f57a-489b-a2a9-9b565ed0ddc1",
                        "source_entry_id": "60a39e6d-68fd-3115-8345-dce9287ccd28",
                        "source_sense_id": "be54201a-d02a-369e-abdf-45ff9f002ce2",
                        "target_lang_word": "by hand",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "by hand",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a46f6235-ef2b-3937-ae8b-44576893a254",
                                        "entry_id": "884d0fb7-e4f7-3e08-a05d-3c6cfb6ff91b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Manually; without the use of automation or machines."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "idiomatic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a2b50b9-93d0-4612-a6ba-02284fbc8663",
                                                "sense_id": "a46f6235-ef2b-3937-ae8b-44576893a254",
                                                "text": "The computers went down and they had to do all the bookkeeping by hand that day."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a98f52dc-f2f0-4039-b4e7-b62ec85e04f2",
                                                "sense_id": "a46f6235-ef2b-3937-ae8b-44576893a254",
                                                "text": "Georgia’s secretary of state announced Wednesday that the state will conduct an audit of the 2020 presidential race, recounting by hand the millions of ballots cast in the state, where President-elect Joe Biden is leading.\n“With the margin being so close, it will require a full by hand recount in each county,” Secretary of State Brad Raffensperger, a Republican, said at a news conference in Atlanta. “This will help build confidence.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cfb7e7d-3596-464d-8d2b-bbeca34d0296",
                                                "sense_id": "a46f6235-ef2b-3937-ae8b-44576893a254",
                                                "text": "A full set costs $245 and takes around 10 to 14 days to make by hand."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3fe871b0-3157-37d4-8e3a-2404af09ebe1",
                                        "entry_id": "884d0fb7-e4f7-3e08-a05d-3c6cfb6ff91b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without suckling it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of raising a child"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57cc72e0-3f54-49de-911b-703567e3ad3e",
                                                "sense_id": "3fe871b0-3157-37d4-8e3a-2404af09ebe1",
                                                "text": "to bring up an infant by hand"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40d000b9-aaa9-4a9c-8e86-8c562a76fc12",
                                                "sense_id": "3fe871b0-3157-37d4-8e3a-2404af09ebe1",
                                                "text": "That left me an orphan and folks were at their wits’ end, so Mrs. Thomas said, what to do with me. [...] Finally Mrs. Thomas said she’d take me, though she was poor and had a drunken husband. She brought me up by hand. Do you know if there is anything in being brought up by hand that ought to make people who are brought up that way better than other people? Because whenever I was naughty Mrs. Thomas would ask me how I could be such a bad girl when she had brought me up by hand--reproachful-like."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "70a17d13-cf38-467c-a667-db54bcfe6c94",
                        "source_entry_id": "60a39e6d-68fd-3115-8345-dce9287ccd28",
                        "source_sense_id": "be54201a-d02a-369e-abdf-45ff9f002ce2",
